{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002430","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002430"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002430","label":"髙信（趙世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"髙信","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0041"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0041","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p081","quote":"髙信"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-043","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0041"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:p081"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-043-zhao"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"髙信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002430","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p081","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-201","person_id":"cbr-p002430","surfaces":["髙信"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p081","quote":"主父及王游沙丘，異宮，公子章卽以其徒與田不禮作亂，詐以主父令召王。肥義先入，殺之。髙信卽與王戰。公子成與李兌自國至，乃起四邑之兵入距難，殺公子章及田不禮，滅其黨賊而定王室。公子成爲相，號安平君，李兌爲司寇。公子章之敗，往走主父，主主開之，成、兌因圍主父宮。公子章死，公子成、李兌謀曰：「以章故圍主父，卽解兵，吾屬夷矣。」乃遂圍主父。令宮中人「後出者夷」，宮中人悉出。主父欲出不得，又不得食，探爵鷇而食之，三月餘而餓死沙丘宮。主父定死，乃發喪赴諸侯。"}],"rationale":"限本篇人物、連續政治事件及明示生子是為敘事；武靈王／主父、王子何／惠文王及惠后吳娃按本文連接。公子章不與早期敬侯章合併，何不與較早趙何合併；髙信與信期、趙袑與周袑分候選。王賁不按熟知秦將同名接人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p081","text":"主父及王游沙丘，異宮，公子章卽以其徒與田不禮作亂，詐以主父令召王。肥義先入，殺之。髙信卽與王戰。公子成與李兌自國至，乃起四邑之兵入距難，殺公子章及田不禮，滅其黨賊而定王室。公子成爲相，號安平君，李兌爲司寇。公子章之敗，往走主父，主主開之，成、兌因圍主父宮。公子章死，公子成、李兌謀曰：「以章故圍主父，卽解兵，吾屬夷矣。」乃遂圍主父。令宮中人「後出者夷」，宮中人悉出。主父欲出不得，又不得食，探爵鷇而食之，三月餘而餓死沙丘宮。主父定死，乃發喪赴諸侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"公子章","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002421","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"其徒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"田不禮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002427","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"髙信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002430","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0048","start":48,"end":51,"surface":"公子成","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002404","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zh